{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cd5da68cf18e718ef05b210509a9855cf0fe39db1e6c88cd544ccd3b5580ebee", "ja": "（39プロジェクトの始動に伴い、\n春香の宣材写真も取り直すことになった）", "zh": "（为了配合39PROJECT的开始，\n春香的宣传照也要重拍。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "9da4e84c2e2f2844b21d543c9b108eb939bce4526cb011ce459ed5b7d2ec5d4f", "ja": "本日は撮影、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "今天的拍摄，就麻烦各位多多指教了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e7ee411d4820a4de94990ccbc7256fd1654ad1e0d510e262b4b0fba2df03e184", "ja": "（春香はいつになく真剣な様子で撮影に臨み、\nその仕事ぶりはスタッフさん達からも高評価だった！）", "zh": "（春香在拍摄时比以往都还要认真，\n工作人员们看到她这么敬业也赞赏不绝！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_1003_p", "source_sha256": "550cb2b0b123e54033216e18e7931b9f69e59bb16441ed934e4d34918fc1b965", "ja": "よし、次の現場に行こう春香。今日もスケジュール\nびっしりだからな。さて、次の現場は……。", "zh": "好，去下个工作地点吧，春香。\n今天也是行程满档。我看看，下个地点在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cf48d9803ef373aea03711c39237e2877d287d6b987cfd1a24fe74ac5cba80ee", "ja": "春香？　どうかしたのか？", "zh": "春香？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "02cf0788cbd2fd6e3d61cce483338b171f98af47a06381dad27b78abb445bd30", "ja": "え？　あっ、ご、ごめんなさいっ！\nちょっと、気が抜けちゃって……えへへ。", "zh": "咦？啊，对、对不起！\n我一放松下来就……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_1007_p", "source_sha256": "186e082dae1b90f625d90d8f36ec7f95d86ae9c3a13e7ce986c6c117990b3c7e", "ja": "撮影の時はあんなに元気だったのに……。\n何か心配事でもあるのか？", "zh": "你在拍摄时明明那么有活力……\n是在担心些什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "fe101a28e077be0008ee0117e5ce8b9892cf9ec4c656e9aa905f17de16f9ab65", "ja": "えへへ、{$P$}さんは、\nなんでもお見通しなんですね……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，什么事都瞒不过\n{$P$}先生呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_1010_p", "source_sha256": "bdee36bbd73a88ee21df64eab8f546572181a81fa25f35b6146b7221f8594824", "ja": "まあ、様子がおかしかったから。\nどうしたんだ？", "zh": "因为你看起来不太对劲。\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "a25a79a0a1927664d1a4159a6d26f347181b54c75a15c80432c0274e41357a5a", "ja": "実は私、39プロジェクトがすっごく楽しみで。\nそれで、頑張ろうって思ってたんですけど……。", "zh": "其实我很期待39PROJECT的开始，\n想要藉这个机会好好加油一下，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "3ff73a4114c6d4624b3c92a6ea5d7533f20639c9b8d0b5f88f66a7389f1fa0ac", "ja": "いざ、新人のみんなに囲まれちゃうと、やっぱり……\n私みたいな先輩でいいのかな、って。", "zh": "一想到自己被新人们围绕的画面时，就会担心……\n我这样真的当得了她们的前辈吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "bb087f27368043a6b1f835537da13c812af6f166d271b3528d7015ef66bf8731", "ja": "先輩らしく、ちゃんとできてるかなって。\n仕事も、細かい所が気になっちゃったりして……。", "zh": "我看起来真的有前辈的样子吗……\n工作时也因此一直注意琐碎的小事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4cf9e111465094383c4d2ea1dadadea7031da1a543472e77eeb0173a88b81014", "ja": "（春香……。39プロジェクトは大掛かりだしな。\nプレッシャーを感じるのも無理はない。でも……）", "zh": "（春香……毕竟39PROJECT颇具规模，\n她会感到压力也是难免的，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_1015", "source_sha256": "0e03d92a4ce74c048ac75b490e23cf095830ff7e66876db4d4494bc294461515", "ja": "心配は俺の仕事", "zh": "担心是我的工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_2000_p", "source_sha256": "32386fd782060d19309e1cfb55989bb2fe17d4290e67b26b8512d7ecb5025eaa", "ja": "俺の仕事を取らないでくれよ。\n新人のことも春香のことも、心配は俺の仕事だ。", "zh": "你可别抢了我的工作喔。\n不管是新人还是春香，都交给我来担心就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_2001_001har", "source_sha256": "e0779e7b76f8ee217f1423e56b114878b9f344aee3a6513292427b07134747c6", "ja": "あ、ごめんなさいっ。\n私、もしかして勝手にでしゃばり過ぎですか？", "zh": "啊，对不起！\n我是不是管太多了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_2002_p", "source_sha256": "33bef27bfe0d3239fdd4e8730161f38ac5a31d5382a656b003529be3ad483154", "ja": "いや、助かってるけどな。でも、周りを気にかけすぎて\n落ち込まれると、ちょっと困るかもしれない。", "zh": "不会，我是很感谢你这样，但看你因为\n太在意周围而情绪低落，我也是会伤脑筋的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_2003_001har", "source_sha256": "cfc6566bfecaad33e0ec17be97717e165e50acde7dc95713b5cd961f3f7d7b76", "ja": "うう……。す、すみません……。", "zh": "呜呜……对、对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_2004_p", "source_sha256": "41692f917d6b4f3407e0ed81171ee7bb2168c5d3575b0a33987acf1a261f132a", "ja": "春香、これだけは覚えておいて欲しいんだけど。\n先輩に不安があったら、後輩は作らないよ。", "zh": "春香，有一件事，希望你能好好记住：\n要是我们对你这个前辈没有信心，自然不会去招收新人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_2005_p", "source_sha256": "d961c85f566a3b21604845baa4896bc9f88b71614493fc77dcd071bf958b4a53", "ja": "春香達が立派な先輩になれると思ったから、\n39プロジェクトは立ち上がったんだ。", "zh": "正因为认为春香你们会是新人的榜样，\n事务所才会发起39PROJECT的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_2006_p", "source_sha256": "8b38960f91b197ddef375fd320c48fdd2650d57ea5219e563eaaa0b43232565b", "ja": "今日の撮影だって、見事な手際だったじゃないか？", "zh": "今天的拍摄工作，你不也展现了漂亮的成果吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_2007_001har", "source_sha256": "5fdc0f27bb607e6b360d7851e4648542879824b00f392350092e3e61d5b1fb03", "ja": "あれは……。撮影のお仕事は何度かしてますから、\nその、誰でも……。", "zh": "那是因为……拍摄的工作已经有很多经验了，\n不管换谁来，一定都……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_2008_p", "source_sha256": "7d4e3a38fd9c0a25a5e9a3eab36bafb3bf2ceeb358e6daa0c2917ef653c41431", "ja": "春香達なら、誰でもできるかもな。\nでも多分、新人の子達には、まだ無理かな。", "zh": "我想春香你们一定都没问题。\n可是，对之后的新人们来说，应该还是个挑战。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_2009_001har", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_2010_p", "source_sha256": "0f9deddee633840cfff8d2645f752ecfc743b9eb942643ddab86d44bd7b67bb3", "ja": "立派なお手本になれてるんだ。\nもう少し、自分を信じてあげてもいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "你确实是值得新人效法的对象。\n我觉得你可以更有自信一些喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_2011_001har", "source_sha256": "e8ccf6a1983d6e6c9ad2e55fb990239924dcea34699be5171d084816b89fa29f", "ja": "そっか。進め方とか、知ってるだけでも……。", "zh": "对耶，光是知道工作的流程，就很有帮助了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_2012_001har", "source_sha256": "c5adbe60c109868f740bdee3df71f32be3d881e98e9f4ce2dded79307b763688", "ja": "えへへっ、ありがとうございます！\nあの、なんだか……大丈夫な気がしてきました♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你！\n那个，我觉得……自己好像没问题了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_2013_001har", "source_sha256": "66a24b618cec8991b199ed712ca88210d46a7d2f026f98db5c9b7bb848a9d2a8", "ja": "それじゃあ、プロジェクトの成功のためにも……。\nまずは次のお仕事をきっちりと、ですね♪", "zh": "那么，为了PROJECT的成功……\n我也得先完美结束下一个工作才行呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_2014_p", "source_sha256": "9733f8653fa40c8cc585e095ff16b9394af40542c58530394a85aa6bd46d3e1c", "ja": "そういうことだ。\nさあ、気合いを入れて行こう！", "zh": "就是这样。\n来，打起精神出发吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_2015_001har", "source_sha256": "8c889c7103b7d980dd0f7f4d5da640bfc690225cc8b45aae1cd7024e44606496", "ja": "はい！　新しい子達のためにも……、\nそれに、私のためにも。", "zh": "好！为了未来的新人们……\n也为了我自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_2016_001har", "source_sha256": "6c94487a8f5cc0262a7314f414840ff6dea5f7bbea9030ddb0a3748f27225e0a", "ja": "できることをひとつひとつ、\nやっていこうって思います♪", "zh": "我想要脚踏实地，\n一点一滴完成自己力所能及的事♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_002_2017_p", "source_sha256": "43eede3c6d0fd720e28ca34b79ff725c3949431734acc4255404ce6cb422e73a", "ja": "（プロジェクトの成功のために、か。頼もしいな。\nもしかしたら今後、1番変わるのは春香かもしれない）", "zh": "（为了PROJECT的成功吗……真是可靠。\n说不定今后改变最大的，就是春香呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
